* prod.inp - production CpHMD single pH = 4.5
* Uses CHARMM PHMD module commands (phmd ...)
*

read rtf card name top_all36_prot.rtf
read para card name par_all36_prot.prm

read psf card name init.psf
read coor pdb name equil_coords.pdb

! Nonbonded / PME setup (adjust grid sizes to match box)

nbond atom vatom vdistance 14.0 atom cutnb 14.0 ctonnb 12.0 ctofnb 10.0 -
      eps 1.0 e14fac 1.0
para nbond
! In CHARMM, typical PME setup commands exist; grid size can be auto-determined in some builds.

! PHMD / CpHMD configuration (single pH run)
! Set global pH value

phmd setup ph 4.5

! Read titration list file produced by the generator
! Format: RESNAME  RESNUM  CHAIN  (one per line)

phmd titrate read card name titration_list.txt

! Optional: set lambda-dynamics and metropolis parameters (defaults may be chill)

phmd lambda scale 1.0
phmd metropolis interval 1000    ! attempt MC every 1000 steps (example)
phmd metropolis prob 1.0

! Turn on PHMD so titration moves are active during dynamics
phmd on

! Start production dynamics — here 4 ns (2,000,000 steps @ 0.002 ps, ig u could change?)
dynamics langevin verlet nstep 2000000 timestep 0.002 -
    firstt 300.0 finalt 300.0 tbath 300.0 -
    nprint 5000 iun 0 iunw 0

! Turn off PHMD and write final outputs
phmd off

! Write coordinates and PHMD outputs
write coor pdb name prod_coords.pdb
write coor card name prod_coords.crd

! Save PHMD information (lambda traces/titration logs)
phmd write titration history name phmd_lambda_history.dat
phmd write summary name phmd_summary.txt
